# Nail — English texts of the conversation list (P2 WP-list, ADR 0148):
# conversation rows (Design A), expandable child rows (Design B), the list's
# keys. Shared words ("me", counts) are in conversations.ftl.

## Actions (the list's keys → / ←; the command palette)

conversation-list-action-expand = Open conversation
conversation-list-action-expand-keywords = expand thread messages show children
conversation-list-action-collapse = Close conversation
conversation-list-action-collapse-keywords = collapse thread messages hide children
